      "message": "[warning] Line 260: 🟡 The tile border highlight now depends only on `tile.hovered`, so keyboard navigation (`GridView.isCurrentItem`) has no visible selection state. This is an accessibility/UX regression because Enter opens the current item but users can’t reliably see which item is selected without a mouse. Include `tile.highlighted` (and optionally `tile.activeFocus`) in the border/background highlight condition, e.g. `border.color: (tile.hovered || tile.highlighted) ? ...`.",
